<title>USA: Noven says Rhone-Poulenc Rorer buys stake.</title>
<headline>Noven says Rhone-Poulenc Rorer buys stake.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noven Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Tuesday that Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc has purchased 500,000 shares of Noven common stock at $8.00.</p>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer made this $4 million investment through the partial exercise of a one million share warrant which was granted in 1992.</p>
<p>Noven has extended the warrant for the remaining 500,000 shares for a period of 18 months.</p>
<p>As of the end of the company's first quarter, Noven had approximately 19.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
